w: Lord, who through- out these for- ty days For us didst fast and pray,
w: As Thou with Sa- tan didst con- tend, And didst the vic- t'ry win,
w: As Thou didst hun- ger bear, and thirst, So teach us, gra- cious Lord,
w: And through these days of pen- i- tence, And through Thy pa- ssion- tide,
w: A- bide with us, that so, this life Of suf- f'ring o- ver past,
